Package: lxb-toolkit-dev
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Piotr Lewandowski <piotr.petexy@gmail.com>
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDS@, lxb-toolkit (= @VERSION@-1)
Recommends: rustup | cargo
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/petexy/lxb-toolkit
Description: header, static library and application generator for lxb-toolkit
 The C header, the static archive, the pkg-config file, and lxb-new: the
 generator that creates a runnable Wayland application with a matching desktop
 entry and icon, already speaking the design language.
 .
 Also installs the toolkit's Rust crate sources under /usr/share/lxb-toolkit,
 which is what a generated project builds against on a machine that has never
 seen the upstream checkout. Cargo reads a path or a registry rather than a
 library directory, which is why the sources ship rather than only the library.
